+        current network ACL with the default.
+
+        :type subnet_id: str
+        :param subnet_id: The ID of the subnet to which the ACL belongs.
+
+        :type vpc_id: str
+        :param vpc_id: The ID of the VPC to which the ACL/subnet belongs. Queries EC2 if omitted.
